WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Fuzz this project: oxfuzz picks decode_utf8, the AI drafts a libFuzzer harness, and the sandbox compiles and smoke-tests it.

2
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Build options and smoke-test evidence (sped up 4x).

3
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:46.000
An independent model review passed and the smoke test already hit a crash. A person approves the harness.

4
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.500
The approved harness runs in the sandbox for one minute (sped up 12x).

5
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:07.833
Run finished: one crash artifact retained. The panel shows the model calls this run made.

6
00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:16.333
Triage: Scan for Crashes replays and classifies the crash in the sandbox, with no AI call (sped up 2x).

7
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:50.333
heap-buffer-overflow (read) at utf8.c:31 with the AddressSanitizer stack; not called exploitable until reviewed.
